{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>When you take.</b> A term of receiving, as its Targum renders — when you wish to receive the total of their count to know how many they are, do not count them by head, but let each one give a half-shekel and you shall count the shekels and know their number." "<b>And there shall be no plague among them.</b> For counting dominates over them the evil eye, and pestilence comes upon them, as we find in the days of David (II Samuel 24)."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:55:44.300259080Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}